OL,3,GNEWSAHuntingdon train attacker found
OL,4,Aguilty of all 14 counts of attempted
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,8,Fof 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,10,FWilliams, 33, stabbed 10 people on an
OL,11,FLNER train to London as it passed
OL,12,Fthrough Cambridgeshire on 1 November
OL,13,Flast year
OL,15,FHe was also found guilty of four counts
OL,16,Fof attempted murder away from the
OL,17,Ftrain, in Peterborough and London
OL,19,FThe jury initially found Williams
OL,20,Fguilty of seven counts, but hadn't
OL,21,Freached verdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
